WEBVTT

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.070
I have come from Quiberon
to carry out certain orders.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.320
You cannot win.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:16.530
I came to ask Angelina Saiga
to dismantle my body.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.540
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.590
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:33.180
And the gears turn

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.150
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.030
The story waits for no-one

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.900
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:55.240
A red past chases after you

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.490
The jester's smile

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.370
What's behind the mask?

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.210
You can't erase the scars

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:06.170
No matter how they burn

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.000
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:11.960
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:17.640
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.810
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:24.390
That's the cue to begin

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:28.110
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:32.150
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.030
So hold them in now and keep going

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.740
Until the day the curtain falls

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:45.210
The gears will keep turning

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.220
#18 A smile

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.220
Oh my, suckling already?

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.010
What a strong healthy girl.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.850
Mr. Saiga, have you already
decided on a name for her?

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.020
-Yes, for if we had a girl.
-Yes.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.320
Welcome to this world.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.530
Éléonore.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.030
We'll call her Ellie then.
What a nice name.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.740
Guy.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.040
Thank you for everything.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.830
It's all thanks to you
that she was born safely.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:30.960
It's nothing.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.630
You're quite a lady.
You didn't panic watching her give birth.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:40.220
You'll do great
when you have babies of your own.

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.480
What the heck am I doing?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.950
I have to take the soft stone
out of Angelina.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.030
And implant it in the baby.
That's my mission.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:02.620
Guy.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.620
Could you watch Éléonore?
I need to go get the laundry.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.250
How the heck am I supposed to...

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.300
You put her too close to the fire.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.390
Dang this rickety house!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.560
It's cold, gosh darn it.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:37.190
I wish to be dismantled
after she grows big.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.950
How long will it take?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.740
A day?

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.240
It'll take much longer than that.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.700
Humans take a long time
to grow up.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.960
We learn many things
like sadness and joy.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.920
It takes roughly 20 years
for humans to become adults.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.130
20 years?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.590
I cannot wait that long.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.840
I must have you dismantle me.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.100
Do you still feel that way?

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.980
I've grown tired from trying to smile.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:17.110
I cannot meet my Creator
who wished me to smile.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.700
There is no path
but to cease my existence.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.450
I see.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:28.490
But you were there for me
when this child was born.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.830
So I don't want to break you.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:37.380
What are you talking about?
Many people are suffering because of her.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:38.920
You and me, too!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.130
I haven't forgotten about it, either.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.470
But now...

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:51.850
I don't want my daughter to have to live
in the shadow of past grudges.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.900
No matter what Angelina says,
you are my enemy.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.690
If you're up to something,
you better speak.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:06.370
I am the most human-like automaton
there has ever been.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.540
But I've always felt...

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.830
that I'm missing a vital gear.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.170
I'm not sure what it is.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:22.470
But I felt like I could be something
if I only had it.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.550
So, have you now found out
what you're missing?

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.970
No.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:33.810
But I haven't thought much about it
ever since I came here.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:38.190
I can't be human
because of the missing gear.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:41.940
And I only exist because of my hair.

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.490
What do you mean?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:50.030
My Creator implanted on me the hair
of the woman I was modeled after.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:54.000
To make me into a reincarnation of her.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:06:00.000
So this hair is the only reason
the machine before you exists.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.710
But the baby...

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:05.590
Éléonore.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:10.640
She cried, not caring if I were
a human or a machine.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:15.640
She wailed and squeezed my finger.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:22.690
I feel like I could become something else
when I'm with Éléonore.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.360
She squeezed your finger?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.070
So what?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.540
I made her a toy train!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.540
I changed her diaper.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:40.170
I put baby powder on her
so she won't get a rash.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:45.920
When I gave her a bath,
she grabbed my sleeve and wouldn't let go.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.720
Oh yeah? Well...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.180
Gosh darn it!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.930
Éléonore is so darn cute.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.770
Yes, I could watch her forever.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:09.490
I guess if you wanted to kill us,
you'd have done it during the delivery.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:16.250
It's almost Éléonore's nap time.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.670
Yes. But before that,
I must change her diaper.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.720
What's going on?

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.560
Aren't you going to the festival
at the neighboring village, too?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:43.690
Mr. Shoji said he's going to treat
everyone to a wonderful meal.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.980
He didn't tell us.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.240
She looks just like you.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:54.240
Why, she looks like you, too.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.080
You've grown pale.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:05.340
Like you've given all your energy
to Éléonore.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.590
Yes, but dear.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:12.430
That doesn't seem to be all.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.310
Oh dear, what's the matter?

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:20.730
There, there.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.780
My darling child

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:32.780
My beloved child

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:37.790
Just like the leaves

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:42.830
That dance in the wind

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:49.000
Your little bed

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.720
Sways to and fro

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.760
Heavenly Father

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.770
In thy kingdom above

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:08.820
Give one to this child

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:13.950
And one to each of us

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.240
Someday, please

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.410
Bestow your blessing

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:30.630
Upon us all

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.890
A village festival? I didn't know.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:41.680
I heard Shoji had arranged
a meal for everybody.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.730
I never said such a thing.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:46.400
Then who...?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.940
That sound. It's automata.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.780
They've finally come.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.120
Did you call them here?

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.000
-Francine?
-Don't worry.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.750
I will make them leave.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:08.880
I am the leader of all automata.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.710
They will listen to my orders.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.470
There're so many.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.190
My darling little puppets.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:29.440
I thank you for your loyalty.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.900
I order you, as the head
of the Midnight Circus.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.200
Leave this place.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.580
Leave.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:53.590
Who the hell are you?

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:57.930
Where's the soft stone?
Which human is it inside?

00:10:58.930 --> 00:10:59.890
Francine!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:03.560
Please, believe me...

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.850
Why won't they listen to me?

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.600
Guy, bring Olympia.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.270
Angelina, take Éléonore and run.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.360
Let me fight, too.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:19.490
Impossible.
You're weaker than a human now.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.160
I'll fight, too.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.040
Francine.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.790
Take Éléonore and the soft stone.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:34.040
You mean,
the soft stone is inside her now?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.340
I can fight with Arlequin.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.630
But you can't.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.930
So you take her and escape.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:48.640
You are going to trust me?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.440
Yes.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.230
There, be a good girl now.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.820
May you be blessed with plenty of joy.

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:03.200
Wait, how can you trust her?
It might all be part of a plot.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.950
I trust her.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.200
It's our only choice.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.660
This way. Go.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.080
You better guard her through.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.500
I will.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.090
She ran with something.

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:20.420
Must be the soft stone.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:28.060
I've killed many humans
and caused much suffering.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.680
What a horrifying being I was.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:36.360
But those humans trusted me with Éléonore.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:39.650
They trusted me, a puppet.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.650
I must repay their trust.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.410
I will protect this child.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:58.420
I wish I could've smiled just once.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.510
But now...

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.310
It's no use.
I'm too weak to climb this now.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.730
Besides, there are automata up there.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.240
What's wrong?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:35.580
This water is too cold for human babies.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.840
You measly...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:45.680
Long sword "koku." Short sword "raijin."

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.760
These two swords are wet with my blood.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:54.430
Shirogane blood with Aqua Vitae nullifies
automata's synthetic body fluids.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:59.060
Dance, Olympia!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.070
Come, automata.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.320
The soft stone is inside me.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:14.040
Angelina is drawing the automata to her.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:19.290
For some reason, the soft stone
has transferred into little Éléonore.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.500
She's standing out so they don't notice.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.720
Hang in there, Éléonore.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.530
It's turning a rose color.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.490
Aqua Vitae?

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.530
The soft stone is inside you?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.290
It's responding to you being in danger.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.800
I'm sorry.
It's my fault for falling in here.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:08.220
It must've been scary. It must've hurt.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:11.180
Don't cry now. What should I do?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.100
What should I do?

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:24.480
My darling child

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:29.070
My beloved child

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:34.530
Just like the leaves

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:39.210
That dance in the wind

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:44.590
Your little bed

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:48.880
Sways to and fro

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:54.550
Heavenly Father

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:59.180
In thy kingdom above

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:04.480
Give one to this child

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:09.440
And one to each of us

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:14.200
Someday, please

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:19.410
Bestow your blessing

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:26.840
Upon us all

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.760
Better?

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:35.640
There now.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.910
You'll laugh for me?

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.200
This horrifying puppet?

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:02.960
One more time.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.390
I see stars.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:28.190
I feel so wonderful.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:37.910
How dare you lay your hands...

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:39.990
on my child and husband!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.210
Angelina, Angelina!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.750
Take Angelina and run.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.170
I'll stop them.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.670
Thank you, my darling.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.430
We'll reunite soon.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:07.900
Don't worry. Shiroganes are immortal
thanks to Aqua Vitae.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:12.570
These scratches mean nothing...

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:16.410
But why aren't they closing up?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.030
I'm sorry.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.410
But I think it's over for me.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.540
No, Maman...

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:31.340
You finally called me Maman.

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:38.470
I wanted to hold you like this earlier.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.050
Don't go, Maman.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.010
I've finally...

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:47.600
Look after Éléonore for me.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:52.940
Don't make her walk the same path I did.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:58.110
Don't make her lonely, the way you were.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:02.200
I won't, so don't ever leave me.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.790
Don't leave me alone, Maman!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.710
Call me Maman some more.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.300
For Éléonore, too.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.280
Hey, where's the soft stone?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.320
It's with the one that ran away.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.450
Angelina...!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.080
Protect Éléonore for me.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.460
With this sword.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.590
Maman.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:03.350
I've been a bad boy. I've hurt you a lot.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.970
But I'll be good now.

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.770
I'll protect Éléonore.

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.690
So please, come back.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:18.860
Take this!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:25.030
How do you like that?
Just like that woman!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.370
Go with her to your death!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:34.170
Can we never come back
once we die?

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.960
No chance, if you're human.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.800
Human, huh.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.380
She was a shirogane.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.430
But she was human.

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.310
She was so kind.

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:51.430
Time for you to die!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.610
When did you...?

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:59.070
I know, Angelina.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.070
You are no longer here.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.420
Éléonore!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:25.140
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.180
Aqua Vitae?

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.640
Francine's clothes?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.770
She made that hole
to drain the Aqua Vitae.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.400
Francine did it.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.620
With that broken body,
she hit it over and over.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:53.540
She protected Éléonore till the end.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:00.000
Did you find your missing gear?

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:06.260
Were you able to become something?

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:31.990
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:37.040
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:41.630
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.800 --> 00:22:46.590
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:51.390
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:56.230
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.230
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:05.280
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:09.780
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:15.290
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:23.670
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:31.760
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:39.140
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
